          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "GCS 15. Cranial nerves grossly intact, PERRL, visual fields grossly full, power 5/5 in all limbs, tone and reflexes within normal limits, gait normal. No focal neurological symptoms reported."
      }
    },
